        {
          "text": "Napajua ukaapo, ndipo penye kiti cha enzi cha Shetani; nawe walishika sana jina langu, wala hukuikana imani yangu, hata katika siku za Antipa shahidi wangu, mwaminifu wangu, aliyeuawa kati yenu, hapo akaapo Shetani. ",
